                                                "sense_id": "ea7182c6-25f0-3199-99da-4a2ce4dd1b07",
                                                "text": "The lyrics are different: gone are the dreamy, un-self-conscious proclamations of affection from the EP (which was reissued with additional tracks), replaced with vividly dark broodings, thick with doubt and fear."
